            "action_name": {
              "value": "Overdrive Engine"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(clockwork)\n\nRequirements: Reginald has 175 Hit Points or fewer\n\nReginald gains 200 temporary Hit Points, a +15-foot status bonus to Speed, and a +2 status bonus to melee attack rolls. His body begins to overheat, spewing steam that deals 9d6 fire damage at the beginning of his turn to all creatures within 30 feet (40 basic Reflex save)\n\nAfter 2 rounds, Reginald explodes, dealing 19d6 fire damage to all creatures within 60 feet (40 basic Reflex save)\n\nReginald dies. For the purposes of his Secret of Rebirth ability, the last creature to damage Reginald counts as killing him."
            },
